 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "Being left out may feel, to your brain, a lot like physical pain.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 4.88
  },
  {
   "text": "So that sting when the group goes quiet is not you being dramatic.",
   "start": 5.28,
   "end": 9.62
  },
  {
   "text": "In one study, people left out of a game showed brain activity that rose with their distress.",
   "start": 10.64,
   "end": 15.8
  },
  {
   "text": "Another region was active too, and linked to less distress.",
   "start": 16.74,
   "end": 19.72
  },
  {
   "text": "Feeling it doesn't mean something is wrong, it means people matter to you.",
   "start": 20.88,
   "end": 25.24
  }
 ]
